{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"The authoritative dictionary evidence resolves the review concern: current Mandarin dictionaries describe 杯 itself as a classifier and as a competition prize/tournament marker. Taiwan’s official entries also explicitly state that 盃 is often preferred for the competition sense. I’ll return separate evidence for those claims and preserve the distinction between present usage and older cited examples."}}
