{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"evidence\":[{\"source\":\"Ministry of Education, Taiwan, 國語辭典簡編本 (2021)\",\"field\":\"杯; pronunciation and senses\",\"text\":\"The entry gives Mandarin bēi and three senses: a small container, a cup-shaped prize symbolizing competition victory, and a measure word for items measured by a cup, with examples 一杯水 and 兩杯麵粉. This directly supports current classifier and competition-prize uses of 杯 in this dictionary.\",\"record_character\":\"杯\",\"kind\":\"official_dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://dict.concised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=459&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"title\":\"<杯> 辭典檢視 - 教育部《國語辭典簡編本》2021\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Ministry of Education, Taiwan, 重編國語辭典修訂本 (2021)\",\"field\":\"杯; spelling convention for competition sense\",\"text\":\"The entry gives bēi, a cup-vessel sense, a competition-prize or competition sense with examples 獎杯 and 世界杯, and the classifier examples 一杯水 and 兩杯麵粉. It explicitly says that 盃 is now more commonly used for the competition sense. This supports current Chinese use while preserving a spelling distinction; it does not say that 杯 is never used in that sense.\",\"record_character\":\"杯\",\"kind\":\"official_dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=146&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"title\":\"< 杯 : ㄅㄟ >辭典檢視 - 教育部《重編國語辭典修訂本》2021\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Ministry of Education, Taiwan, 重編國語辭典修訂本 (2021)\",\"field\":\"盃; comparison with 杯\",\"text\":\"The entry treats 盃 as a bēi noun, lists vessel and classifier senses, and gives competition-prize/competition examples 獎盃 and 世界盃. It explicitly cross-references 杯. Read alongside the 杯 entry, this supports a spelling preference for 盃 in competition contexts in this dictionary, while both forms have vessel and classifier senses.\",\"record_character\":\"盃\",\"kind\":\"official_dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=147&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"title\":\"< 盃 : ㄅㄟ >辭典檢視 - 教育部《重編國語辭典修訂本》2021\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Ministry of Education, Taiwan, 國語辭典簡編本 (2021)\",\"field\":\"獎杯; current compound usage\",\"text\":\"The entry defines 獎杯 as a cup-shaped prize or souvenir awarded to winners in a competition, often made of metal. This independently confirms current use of 杯 in the competition-prize compound 獎杯 in the dictionary’s Taiwan Mandarin coverage.\",\"record_character\":\"杯\",\"kind\":\"official_dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://dict.concised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=23467&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"title\":\"<獎杯> 辭典檢視 - 教育部《國語辭典簡編本》2021\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Ministry of Education, Taiwan, 教育部異體字字典 (2024)\",\"field\":\"盃; variant relationship and attested senses\",\"text\":\"The entry labels 盃 an alternate form of 杯 and records vessel and classifier senses with historical literary citations. These examples document cited historical usage; they do not by themselves establish when those senses began or how the classifier sense developed.\",\"record_character\":\"盃\",\"kind\":\"official_variant_dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://dict.variants.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=29413&la=0\",\"title\":\"[A02740] 盃 - 教育部《異體字字典》 臺灣學術網路十四版（正式七版）2024\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"漢典\",\"field\":\"杯; current Mandarin pronunciation and classifier and prize senses\",\"text\":\"The entry gives 杯 bēi, describes it as a cup-shaped competition prize with examples including 奖杯, 杯赛, and 夺杯, and separately marks a measure-word use with examples 一杯水 and 三杯酒. Its pronunciation and examples provide a Chinese dictionary cross-check of both current senses.\",\"record_character\":\"杯\",\"kind\":\"dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://zdic.net/hans/%E6%9D%AF\",\"title\":\"杯 bēi - 汉典\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"漢典\",\"field\":\"奖杯; current compound usage\",\"text\":\"The entry gives 奖杯 jiǎng bēi and defines it as a commemorative cup granted to an award recipient; its national-language dictionary section specifies a cup-shaped metal item awarded to winners in sporting competitions. This supports contemporary use of 杯 in the award compound.\",\"record_character\":\"杯\",\"kind\":\"dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://zdic.net/hans/%E5%A5%96%E6%9D%AF\",\"title\":\"奖杯的意思|汉典「奖杯」词语解释\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編《字源》, 2012, ISBN 9787552800692; scan inspected directly in this invocation\",\"field\":\"PDF p. 534, printed p. 521; 桮(杯) headword and graphic-history paragraph; source scan /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0534/source.png; source_pixel_sha256 b1b8aa1a0816b15211ac2e5bf3c31ec681d8c077d8755d777df847c7d5902dfd\",\"text\":\"The scan’s headword is 桮(杯). Its entry calls the Warring States forms phonosemantic, from 木 with 不 supplying sound, and says a horizontal stroke over 不 and short strokes in one graph are decorative. It says Qin forms continue the Warring States writing, with 不 sometimes elaborated by 口 into 否. The entry describes variation in Han forms and cites vessel uses, the measure phrase 一杯水 in Mencius, and other examples. These are the book’s claims and citations; they do not establish dates of the cited physical witnesses or a full semantic chronology.\",\"record_character\":\"杯\",\"kind\":\"locally_inspected_book\",\"url\":\"https://ci.nii.ac.jp/ncid/BB13266817\",\"title\":\"字源 — 李學勤主編, 天津古籍出版社, 2012, ISBN 9787552800692\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編《字源》, 2012, ISBN 9787552800692; continuation scan inspected directly in this invocation\",\"field\":\"PDF p. 535, printed p. 522; continuation page checked; source scan /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0535/source.png; source_pixel_sha256 9b4c0882da766def379c638663830b1a887bfdc11ecfceb8e51d500089ba6509\",\"text\":\"The continuation page begins with the preceding 檠(盤) entry’s final discussion, then starts the separate 木部 headword 杓. It does not continue the 桮(杯) entry. This confirms the page boundary and that the adjacent 木-entry prose should not be used as evidence for 杯.\",\"record_character\":\"杯\",\"kind\":\"locally_inspected_book_boundary_check\",\"url\":\"https://ci.nii.ac.jp/ncid/BB13266817\",\"title\":\"字源 — 李學勤主編, 天津古籍出版社, 2012, ISBN 9787552800692\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"}],\"search_audit\":[{\"query\":\"site:zdic.net 杯 量词 奖杯 杯 现代汉语词典; site:dict.revised.moe.edu.tw 杯 量詞 獎杯 盃; site:dict.variants.moe.edu.tw 杯 獎杯 量詞 現代 用法; site:dict.baidu.com 杯 量词 奖杯 现代汉语\",\"urls\":[\"https://zdic.net/hans/%E6%9D%AF\",\"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=147&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"https://zdic.net/hans/%E5%A5%96%E6%9D%AF\"],\"outcome\":\"Search returned Han Dian and Taiwan MOE entries. Opened the 杯 dictionary entry, the MOE 盃 entry, and Han Dian’s 奖杯 entry. Search snippets located the MOE 杯 entry; it was opened directly in a later call and inspected.\"},{\"query\":\"site:dict.revised.moe.edu.tw 杯 bēi 量詞 獎杯 字典 杯; site:dict.concised.moe.edu.tw 杯 量詞 獎杯; site:dict.variants.moe.edu.tw 「杯」 量詞 獎盃; 教育部 重編國語辭典 杯 杯狀 獎品 量詞\",\"urls\":[\"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=146&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"https://pedia.cloud.edu.tw/Entry/Detail/?search=%E6%9D%AF&title=%E6%9D%AF\",\"https://dict.concised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=459&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"https://dict.concised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=23467&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"https://dict.variants.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=29413&la=0\"],\"outcome\":\"Located official Taiwan MOE dictionary entries for 杯 and 盃, the concise 杯 and 獎杯 entries, and the variant dictionary. Opened and inspected the concise dictionary and variant dictionary pages; direct opening of the revised 杯 entry initially returned a cache miss, but a later direct open succeeded.\"},{\"query\":\"汉典 杯 bēi 量词 奖杯 今多用杯 杯赛 official dictionary; 现代汉语词典 杯 量词 杯状奖品 杯赛 在线; 教育部国语辞典 简编本 杯 盃 今多用 盃 量词\",\"urls\":[\"https://dict.concised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=459&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=146&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=147&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"https://zdic.net/hans/%E6%9D%AF\",\"https://zdic.net/hans/%E5%A5%96%E6%9D%AF\"],\"outcome\":\"Search results supplied current dictionary senses and spelling notes. Directly opened the three MOE entries, Han Dian’s 杯 entry, and Han Dian’s 奖杯 compound entry. Sources support cup-measure use and competition-prize use, with Taiwan MOE noting that 盃 is more common in competition contexts.\"},{\"query\":\"site:dict.concised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp 杯 世界杯 杯赛 量词; site:dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp 杯 量词 今多用盃; site:zdic.net/hans/杯 杯状锦标 量词 一杯水\",\"urls\":[\"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=146&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"https://zdic.net/hans/%E6%9D%AF\",\"https://dict.concised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=459&la=1&powerMode=0\"],\"outcome\":\"Follow-up searches retrieved already inspected MOE and Han Dian entries, confirming the same sources; no new conflicting analysis surfaced.\"}],\"gaps\":[\"[OCR CORRECTION REQUIRED] 字源 provisional OCR corpus, PDF p. 534 / printed p. 521, headword immediately before “bēi 帮组、之部”: raw OCR span “楛(杯)” should read “桮(杯)” based on direct inspection of the supplied scan pixels. This is a proposed source-bound correction, not an applied repair. The same page’s graphic-history prose itself correctly discusses “杯” forms; only this headword label is reported here as affected. The preceding 棝 entry is a separate headword. Page 535 begins with the prior 檠(盤) entry continuation and then the unrelated 杓 headword; no 桮(杯) continuation appears there. Corpus source_sha256 for page 534: b1b8aa1a0816b15211ac2e5bf3c31ec681d8c077d8755d777df847c7d5902dfd; page 535: 9b4c0882da766def379c638663830b1a887bfdc11ecfceb8e51d500089ba6509.\",\"The official current-use evidence inspected here is primarily Taiwan MOE Mandarin dictionary evidence. Han Dian provides an additional mainland-oriented dictionary account but is not an official government lexicon. No independent official mainland dictionary was opened during this invocation.\",\"The MOE revised dictionary’s present spelling observation is explicitly scoped to its own Chinese orthographic coverage: it says 盃 is now more commonly used for the competition sense. It does not quantify regional frequency, and the MOE concise dictionary uses 杯 in its prize examples.\" ]}"}}
